2:T622,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How long does a taxi take from Lucerne to Zurich Airport?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The journey typically takes 50-60 minutes depending on traffic conditions. We recommend booking 3 hours before your flight departure for international flights."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you pick me up from a Lake Lucerne boat cruise?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Absolutely. We regularly collect passengers from the SGV boat piers at Lucerne station, Weggis, Vitznau, and other lakeside stops. Just provide your arrival time and pier location."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you offer tours to Mount Pilatus from Lucerne?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We provide transfers to the Pilatus railway stations in Kriens (gondola) and Alpnachstad (cogwheel railway). For the famous golden round trip, we can coordinate both departure and return transport."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What's the taxi fare from Lucerne station to the old town hotels?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Short trips within central Lucerne typically range from CHF 15-25. We offer fixed prices for hotel transfers – contact us for a specific quote."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Are your taxis available during Lucerne Carnival (Fasnacht)?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, though routes may vary due to parade closures. We know the alternative paths and can navigate you around the festivities or to prime viewing locations."}}]}0:{"buildId":"q9HEqRaiDLhskuwZlHWpi","rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"TaxiService\",\"name\":\"Nova Taxi Lucerne\",\"description\":\"Professional taxi service in Lucerne. Airport transfers, Chapel Bridge tours, KKL rides. Book Nova Taxi now – reliable & comfortable.\",\"url\":\"https://ww